window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I loved an Alpha once.</b></p> <p>An unattainable Elite. A former V-Clan Prince.</p> <p>I thought we had a connection. A unique bond founded on our shared values and aspirations. Then he broke my heart with a few choice words.</p> <p>He doesn't want me? Fine. I'll find an Alpha who does, which is how I end up on the stage being introduced as Candidate Thirteen of the Eligible Omega Mate program.</p> <p>Except, there's just one tiny problem—the Alpha who broke my heart is in charge of supervising the mating activities. Which means he's privy to every interview. Every date. Every kiss.</p> <p>How am I supposed to find an appropriate mate when he's watching me with those smoldering irises?</p> <p>Purring possessive comments in my ear…</p> <p>Growling at every male who looks my way…</p> <p>Prowling around my nest…</p> <p>It doesn't help that someone is attacking the Omegas in the program. Now, my Alpha is even more territorial, his feral nature that much more potent.</p> <p>He's refusing to leave my side, and he's promised to do whatever it takes to protect me. Even if it means claiming me for himself.</p> <p><i>This is a standalone dark shifter romance with Omegaverse vibes—A, B, O dynamics with knotting, nesting, and biting. For mature listeners. Narrated in duet style.</i></p>"; 
